➕ <b>Open a port</b>
Pick a preset, or send:
<code>/fw_open 8080/tcp</code>
<code>/fw_allow 10.0.0.0/8 5432/tcp</code>
<code>/fw_deny 198.51.100.7</code>
Every change runs as a trial: the old rules return unless you tap Keep.
--- keyboard ---
[🌍 Web 80+443] → ~1fps|web  [🔐 SSH (limit)] → ~1fps|ssh
[🗄 Postgres from…] → ~1v|fd|pg^fa  [🗄 Redis from…] → ~1v|fd|rd^fa
[⬅️ Back] → ~1v|fw  [🏠 Home] → ~1v|home  [🔄 Refresh] → ~1v|fa
